{%- comment -%}
  Caja de compra del producto (arriba del pliegue).
  Todo el contenido propio de cada producto sale de sus metacampos "axios.*":
    axios.offer_label, axios.hook, axios.subtitle, axios.rating, axios.rating_count, axios.highlights,
    axios.offer_ends, axios.bundles, axios.specs, axios.releasit_url
  La compra la cierra Releasit: al cargar, Releasit oculta el botón del tema y pone el suyo
  (._rsi-buy-now-button) dentro de este formulario. La barra fija y el llamado final
  llevan al inicio de esta sección (ver assets/ax.js). El botón del tema queda como respaldo.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign p = section.settings.product | default: product
  if p == blank
    assign p = collections.all.products.first
  endif
  assign v = p.selected_or_first_available_variant
  assign m = p.metafields.axios

  assign unit_price = v.price
  assign unit_compare = v.compare_at_price | default: 0
  assign on_sale = false
  if unit_compare > unit_price
    assign on_sale = true
    assign pct = unit_compare | minus: unit_price | times: 100 | divided_by: unit_compare | floor
  endif

  assign hook = m.hook.value | default: m.subtitle.value
  assign bundles = m.bundles.value

  # Paquete destacado: el primero que tenga etiqueta. Si ninguno tiene, el primero.
  assign selected_index = 0
  for item in bundles
    assign parts = item | split: '|'
    assign flag = parts[3] | strip
    if flag != blank and selected_index == 0
      assign selected_index = forloop.index
    endif
  endfor
  if selected_index == 0
    assign selected_index = 1
  endif
  assign selected_total = unit_price
  assign selected_qty = 1
-%}

{%- if p != blank -%}
<section class="ax-pdp" id="comprar" data-ax-product="{{ p.id }}">
  <div class="ax-container ax-pdp__grid">
    {%- comment -%} Galería {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="ax-pdp__media">
      <div class="ax-gallery" data-ax-gallery>
        <div class="ax-gallery__stage">
        <div class="ax-gallery__track" data-ax-gallery-track tabindex="0" aria-label="Fotos de {{ p.title | escape }}">
          {%- for media in p.media -%}
            <div class="ax-gallery__slide" data-media-id="{{ media.id }}">
              {%- case media.media_type -%}
                {%- when 'video' -%}
                  {{ media | video_tag: autoplay: true, loop: true, muted: true, playsinline: true, controls: false, image_size: '900x' }}
                {%- when 'external_video' -%}
                  {{ media | external_video_tag }}
                {%- else -%}
                  {%- liquid
                    assign img_loading = 'lazy'
                    assign img_priority = 'auto'
                    if forloop.first
                      assign img_loading = 'eager'
                      assign img_priority = 'high'
                    endif
                  -%}
                  {{
                    media.preview_image
                    | image_url: width: 1200
                    | image_tag:
                      loading: img_loading,
                      fetchpriority: img_priority,
                      widths: '375, 560, 750, 900, 1200',
                      sizes: '(min-width: 768px) 560px, 100vw',
                      alt: media.alt | default: p.title
                  }}
              {%- endcase -%}
            </div>
          {%- else -%}
            <div class="ax-gallery__slide" style="display:grid;place-items:center;color:#b9b9be">{% render 'ax-icon', name: 'box' %}</div>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>

        <div class="ax-gallery__badges">
          {%- if on_sale -%}<span class="ax-badge ax-badge--icon">{% render 'ax-icon', name: 'tag' %}−{{ pct }}% hoy</span>{%- endif -%}
          {%- if m.badge.value != blank -%}<span class="ax-badge ax-badge--dark">{{ m.badge.value }}</span>{%- endif -%}
        </div>

        {%- if p.media.size > 1 -%}
          <button class="ax-gallery__arrow ax-gallery__arrow--prev" type="button" data-ax-gallery-prev aria-label="Foto anterior">{% render 'ax-icon', name: 'chevron-right' %}</button>
          <button class="ax-gallery__arrow ax-gallery__arrow--next" type="button" data-ax-gallery-next aria-label="Foto siguiente">{% render 'ax-icon', name: 'chevron-right' %}</button>
          <div class="ax-gallery__dots" data-ax-gallery-dots>
            {%- for media in p.media -%}
              <button class="ax-gallery__dot" type="button" aria-label="Ver foto {{ forloop.index }}" aria-current="{% if forloop.first %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"></button>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
        </div>

        {%- if p.media.size > 1 -%}
          <div class="ax-gallery__thumbs" data-ax-gallery-thumbs>
            {%- for media in p.media limit: 5 -%}
              <button class="ax-gallery__thumb" type="button" aria-label="Ver foto {{ forloop.index }}" aria-current="{% if forloop.first %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}">
                {{ media.preview_image | image_url: width: 200 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: '' }}
              </button>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} Información y compra {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="ax-pdp__info">
      {%- liquid
        # Aviso de pocas unidades: usa el inventario real. Si no aplica, se muestra la etiqueta de oferta.
        assign low_stock = false
        if section.settings.show_stock and v.inventory_management == 'shopify' and v.inventory_quantity > 0 and v.inventory_quantity <= settings.ax_low_stock
          assign low_stock = true
        endif
      -%}
      <div class="ax-pdp__top">
        {%- if low_stock -%}
          <span class="ax-eyebrow ax-stock"><span class="ax-fire" aria-hidden="true">🔥</span>{{ section.settings.stock_text }}</span>
        {%- elsif m.offer_label.value != blank -%}
          <span class="ax-eyebrow">{% render 'ax-icon', name: 'fire' %}{{ m.offer_label.value }}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if m.rating.value != blank -%}
          {% render 'ax-stars', rating: m.rating.value, count: m.rating_count.value, count_text: section.settings.reviews_total, link: '#resenas', size: 'lg' %}
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      <h1 class="ax-pdp__title">{{ p.title | escape | replace: '|', '<span class="ax-pdp__sep">|</span>' }}</h1>
      {%- if hook != blank -%}<p class="ax-pdp__hook">{% render 'ax-em', text: hook %}</p>{%- endif -%}

      <div class="ax-pdp__price" data-ax-price>
        <span class="ax-price__now{% if on_sale %} ax-price__now--sale{% endif %}" data-ax-price-now>{{ unit_price | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</span>
        <s class="ax-price__was" data-ax-price-was{% unless on_sale %} hidden{% endunless %}>{{ unit_compare | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</s>
        <span class="ax-badge ax-badge--soft ax-badge--icon"{% unless on_sale %} hidden{% endunless %}>{% render 'ax-icon', name: 'tag' %}<span data-ax-price-save>{{ pct }}% Descuento</span></span>
      </div>

      {%- if m.highlights.value != blank -%}
        <ul class="ax-pdp__points">
          {%- for point in m.highlights.value -%}
            <li>{% render 'ax-icon', name: 'check' %}<span>{{ point }}</span></li>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.show_countdown -%}
        {% render 'ax-countdown', ends: m.offer_ends.value, key: p.id, label: section.settings.countdown_label %}
      {%- endif -%}

      <div class="ax-buy" data-ax-buy-box{% if m.releasit_url.value != blank %} data-releasit-url="{{ m.releasit_url.value }}"{% endif %}>
        <form
          method="post"
          action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}"
          id="ax-form-{{ section.id }}"
          accept-charset="UTF-8"
          enctype="multipart/form-data"
          class="ax-buy__form"
          data-ax-form
          data-product-id="{{ p.id }}"
          novalidate
        >
          <input type="hidden" name="form_type" value="product">
          <input type="hidden" name="utf8" value="✓">
          <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ v.id }}" data-ax-variant-id>
          <input type="hidden" name="product-id" value="{{ p.id }}">

          {%- unless p.has_only_default_variant -%}
            {%- for option in p.options_with_values -%}
              <fieldset class="ax-option" data-ax-option="{{ forloop.index0 }}">
                <legend>{{ option.name }}: <span data-ax-option-value>{{ option.selected_value }}</span></legend>
                <div class="ax-option__values">
                  {%- for value in option.values -%}
                    <label class="ax-pill">
                      <input type="radio" name="ax-option-{{ section.id }}-{{ forloop.parentloop.index0 }}" value="{{ value | escape }}"{% if option.selected_value == value %} checked{% endif %}>
                      <span>{{ value }}</span>
                    </label>
                  {%- endfor -%}
                </div>
              </fieldset>
            {%- endfor -%}
            <script type="application/json" data-ax-variants>
              [
                {%- for variant in p.variants -%}
                  {
                    "id": {{ variant.id }},
                    "options": {{ variant.options | json }},
                    "price": {{ variant.price }},
                    "compare": {{ variant.compare_at_price | default: 0 }},
                    "available": {{ variant.available | json }},
                    "media": {{ variant.featured_media.id | default: 0 }}
                  }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
                {%- endfor -%}
              ]
            </script>
          {%- endunless -%}

          {%- if bundles != blank -%}
            <fieldset class="ax-bundles">
              <legend>{{ section.settings.bundles_title }}</legend>
              {%- for item in bundles -%}
                {%- liquid
                  assign parts = item | split: '|'
                  assign b_name = parts[0] | strip
                  assign b_qty = parts[1] | strip | plus: 0
                  if b_qty < 1
                    assign b_qty = 1
                  endif
                  assign b_price_text = parts[2] | strip
                  assign b_flag = parts[3] | strip
                  # La etiqueta viene del metacampo axios.bundles; "Mejor precio" lleva fuego
                  if b_flag == 'Mejor precio'
                    assign b_flag = '🔥 Mejor precio'
                  endif
                  if b_price_text != blank
                    assign b_total = b_price_text | times: 100 | round
                    assign b_custom = true
                  else
                    assign b_total = unit_price | times: b_qty
                    assign b_custom = false
                  endif
                  # Precio de referencia (igual que las ofertas por cantidad de Releasit):
                  # 1 pieza contra el precio de comparación; 2 o más contra el precio actual × piezas.
                  if b_qty == 1 and unit_compare > unit_price
                    assign b_compare = unit_compare
                  else
                    assign b_compare = unit_price | times: b_qty
                  endif
                  assign b_per = b_total | divided_by: b_qty | floor
                  if forloop.index == selected_index
                    assign selected_total = b_total
                    assign selected_qty = b_qty
                  endif
                -%}
                <label class="ax-bundle">
                  <input
                    type="radio"
                    name="quantity"
                    value="{{ b_qty }}"
                    data-ax-bundle
                    data-total="{{ b_total }}"
                    data-custom="{{ b_custom }}"
                    {% if forloop.index == selected_index %}checked{% endif %}
                  >
                  <span class="ax-bundle__card">
                    <span class="ax-bundle__radio" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    <span>
                      <span class="ax-bundle__name">{{ b_name }}</span>
                      <span class="ax-bundle__meta">
                        <span class="ax-bundle__per">{{ b_per | money_without_trailing_zeros }} <small>c/u</small></span>
                      </span>
                    </span>
                    <span class="ax-bundle__prices">
                      <span class="ax-bundle__price">{{ b_total | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</span>
                      {%- if b_compare > b_total -%}<s class="ax-bundle__compare">{{ b_compare | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</s>{%- endif -%}
                    </span>
                  </span>
                  {%- if b_flag != blank -%}<span class="ax-badge ax-bundle__flag">{{ b_flag }}</span>{%- endif -%}
                </label>
              {%- endfor -%}
              {%- if section.settings.bundles_note != blank -%}<p class="ax-bundles__note">{{ section.settings.bundles_note }}</p>{%- endif -%}
            </fieldset>
          {%- else -%}
            <input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1">
          {%- endif -%}

          <button class="ax-btn ax-btn--block ax-btn--pulse" type="submit" data-ax-buy{% unless v.available %} disabled{% endunless %}>
            {%- if v.available -%}
              {%- assign price_text = selected_total | money_without_trailing_zeros -%}
              {% render 'ax-cta-label', price: price_text %}
            {%- else -%}
              <span class="ax-btn__label">Agotado</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </button>
          <p class="ax-buy__msg" role="alert" data-ax-msg></p>
        </form>
      </div>
      {%- comment -%} Fuera del formulario: Releasit inserta su botón al final del form y estos avisos quedan debajo {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if section.settings.secure_text != blank -%}
        <p class="ax-buy__secure">{% render 'ax-icon', name: 'lock' %} {{ section.settings.secure_text }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- comment -%} Tres razones cortas para comprar sin miedo {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- comment -%} Sello de confianza: escudo + compromiso + tres razones para comprar sin miedo {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="ax-assure">
        <span class="ax-assure__shield">{% render 'ax-icon', name: 'shield' %}</span>
        <div class="ax-assure__body">
          {%- if section.settings.verified_text != blank -%}<p class="ax-assure__title">{{ section.settings.verified_text }}</p>{%- endif -%}
          <ul class="ax-assure__items">
            <li>{% render 'ax-icon', name: 'lock' %}<span>{{ section.settings.assure_1 }}</span></li>
            <li>{% render 'ax-icon', name: 'clock' %}<span>{{ section.settings.assure_2 }}</span></li>
            <li>{% render 'ax-icon', name: 'cash' %}<span>{{ section.settings.assure_3 }}</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        {%- if section.settings.show_description and p.description != blank -%}
          <details class="ax-details"{% if section.settings.description_open %} open{% endif %}>
            <summary>Descripción {% render 'ax-icon', name: 'chevron' %}</summary>
            <div class="ax-details__body ax-rte">{{ p.description }}</div>
          </details>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if section.settings.show_specs and m.specs.value != blank or section.settings.show_specs and m.specs_notes.value != blank -%}
          <details class="ax-details">
            <summary>Especificaciones {% render 'ax-icon', name: 'chevron' %}</summary>
            <div class="ax-details__body">
              {%- if m.specs.value != blank -%}
                <dl class="ax-specs">
                  {%- for spec in m.specs.value -%}
                    {%- assign parts = spec | split: '|' -%}
                    <div><dt>{{ parts[0] | strip }}</dt><dd>{{ parts[1] | strip }}</dd></div>
                  {%- endfor -%}
                </dl>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- comment -%} Notas en letra pequeña (metacampo axios.specs_notes, una por renglón) {%- endcomment -%}
              {%- if m.specs_notes.value != blank -%}
                {%- assign note_lines = m.specs_notes.value | newline_to_br | split: '<br />' -%}
                <div class="ax-specs__notes">
                  {%- for line in note_lines -%}
                    {%- assign line = line | strip -%}
                    {%- if line != blank -%}<p>{{ line }}</p>{%- endif -%}
                  {%- endfor -%}
                </div>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
          </details>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if section.settings.shipping_info != blank -%}
          <details class="ax-details ax-details--icon">
            <summary><span>{% render 'ax-icon', name: 'truck' %}{{ section.settings.shipping_title }}</span>{% render 'ax-icon', name: 'chevron' %}</summary>
            <div class="ax-details__body ax-rte">{% render 'ax-tokens', text: section.settings.shipping_info %}</div>
          </details>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if section.settings.guarantee_info != blank -%}
          <details class="ax-details ax-details--icon">
            <summary><span>{% render 'ax-icon', name: 'shield' %}{{ section.settings.guarantee_title }}</span>{% render 'ax-icon', name: 'chevron' %}</summary>
            <div class="ax-details__body ax-rte">{% render 'ax-tokens', text: section.settings.guarantee_info %}</div>
          </details>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} Barra fija de compra (solo el botón, sin precio): visible mientras el botón principal no está en pantalla {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if section.settings.sticky -%}
    <div class="ax-sticky" data-ax-sticky aria-hidden="true">
      <a class="ax-btn" href="#comprar" data-ax-order tabindex="-1">
        {{ section.settings.sticky_label | default: settings.ax_cta_text }}
      </a>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "Product",
      "name": {{ p.title | json }},
      "url": {{ request.origin | append: p.url | json }},
      {%- if p.featured_image -%}
        "image": [{{ p.featured_image | image_url: width: 1200 | prepend: 'https:' | json }}],
      {%- endif -%}
      "description": {{ p.description | strip_html | strip | truncate: 500 | json }},
      {%- if p.vendor != blank -%}"brand": { "@type": "Brand", "name": {{ p.vendor | json }} },{%- endif -%}
      {%- if v.sku != blank -%}"sku": {{ v.sku | json }},{%- endif -%}
      {%- if m.rating.value != blank and m.rating_count.value > 0 -%}
        "aggregateRating": {
          "@type": "AggregateRating",
          "ratingValue": {{ m.rating.value | json }},
          "reviewCount": {{ m.rating_count.value | json }}
        },
      {%- endif -%}
      "offers": {
        "@type": "Offer",
        "priceCurrency": {{ cart.currency.iso_code | json }},
        "price": {{ v.price | divided_by: 100.0 | json }},
        "availability": "https://schema.org/{% if v.available %}InStock{% else %}OutOfStock{% endif %}",
        "url": {{ request.origin | append: p.url | json }}
      }
    }
  </script>
</section>
{%- else -%}
  {% render 'ax-hint', text: 'Crea al menos un producto en Shopify para ver esta sección.' %}
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Producto: caja de compra",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "product", "id": "product", "label": "Producto", "info": "Vacío = el producto de la página. Elige uno solo si usas esta sección en el inicio u otra página." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "El texto de cada producto se llena en su ficha (Productos → producto → Metacampos): axios.offer_label, axios.hook, axios.rating, axios.highlights, axios.offer_ends, axios.bundles, axios.specs." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "reviews_total", "label": "Total de reseñas junto a las estrellas", "info": "Ej. 2,739. Vacío = usa el metacampo axios.rating_count." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_countdown", "label": "Mostrar contador de la oferta", "default": true },
    { "type": "text", "id": "countdown_label", "label": "Texto del contador", "default": "La oferta termina en" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "bundles_title", "label": "Título de los paquetes", "default": "Elige tu paquete" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "single_note", "label": "Detalle del paquete de 1 pieza (ya no se usa)", "default": "Ideal para probar" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "bundles_note", "label": "Nota debajo de los paquetes", "default": "Confirmas la cantidad y tus datos en el formulario de pedido.", "info": "Vacío = no se muestra." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "secure_text", "label": "Texto de seguridad", "default": "Compra segura. Tus datos están protegidos.", "info": "Vacío = no se muestra." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Debajo del botón" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "verified_text", "label": "Sello de confianza: texto", "default": "Tienda comprometida con la calidad y el cumplimiento", "info": "Vacío = no se muestra." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "assure_1", "label": "Columna 1 (candado)", "default": "Compra segura" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "assure_2", "label": "Columna 2 (reloj)", "default": "Pide hoy" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "assure_3", "label": "Columna 3 (efectivo)", "default": "Pago al recibir" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "shipping_title", "label": "Plegable 1: título", "default": "Envíos y devoluciones" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "shipping_info", "label": "Plegable 1: texto", "default": "<p>Te escribimos por WhatsApp para validar tus datos y confirmar tu pedido. Una vez confirmado, lo enviamos en un plazo de 24 a 48 horas y te compartimos el número de rastreo. La entrega a tu domicilio tarda de [envio], según tu ubicación.</p><p>Si tu paquete llega dañado o presenta algún problema, te lo reponemos sin costo.</p>", "info": "Puedes usar [envio] y [dias]. Vacío = no se muestra." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "guarantee_title", "label": "Plegable 2: título", "default": "Nuestra garantía para ti" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "guarantee_info", "label": "Plegable 2: texto", "default": "<p>Queremos que quedes feliz con tu compra. Tu pedido está respaldado por una garantía de [dias] días: si algo no sale como esperabas, escríbenos y lo resolvemos contigo.</p>", "info": "Puedes usar [envio] y [dias]. Vacío = no se muestra." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "stock_text", "label": "Texto de pocas unidades", "default": "¡Quedan pocas unidades!" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_stock", "label": "Mostrar aviso de pocas unidades", "default": true, "info": "Va arriba del título, en lugar de la etiqueta de oferta. Usa el inventario real: solo aparece si el producto rastrea inventario y quedan menos piezas que el límite de Configuración del tema." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_description", "label": "Mostrar \"Descripción\"", "default": true },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_specs", "label": "Mostrar \"Especificaciones\"", "default": true },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "description_open", "label": "Descripción abierta al cargar", "default": false },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "sticky", "label": "Barra fija de compra", "default": true },
    { "type": "text", "id": "sticky_label", "label": "Botón de la barra fija", "default": "Ordenar ahora" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
